  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호바귀에 대한 새로운 사실이 밝혀져서\n마니아들 사이에서 한바탕 난리가 났어요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638BC14ADC0C5D00020B300D55C0020C0C8B85CC6B40020C0ACC2E4C7740020BC1DD600C838C11C000AB9C8B2C8C544B4E40020C0ACC774C5D0C11C0020D55CBC14D0D50020B09CB9ACAC000020B0ACC5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "새로운 사실이요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C8B85CC6B40020C0ACC2E4C774C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 난리요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020B09CB9ACC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호바귀는 크기에 따라\n작은 사이즈, 보통 사이즈,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n큰 사이즈, 특대 사이즈로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n분류됐었는데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638BC14ADC0B2940020D06CAE30C5D00020B530B77C000AC791C7400020C0ACC774C988002C0020BCF4D1B50020C0ACC774C988002C00100001BE00000AD0700020C0ACC774C988002C0020D2B9B3000020C0ACC774C988B85C00100001BE00000ABD84B958B410C5C8B294B370C694002E002E002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니 글쎄!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C80020AE00C384002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그저 사이즈만 차이 나는 게 아니라\n각각이 다른 종류의<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬이었다는 사실이 밝혀진 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C8000020C0ACC774C988B9CC0020CC28C7740020B098B2940020AC8C0020C544B2C8B77C000AAC01AC01C7740020B2E4B9780020C885B958C75800100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACC774C5C8B2E4B2940020C0ACC2E4C7740020BC1DD600C9C40020AC70C608C694002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 새로 붙은 이름이\n소과종, 중과종,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n대과종, 특대과종이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C0C8B85C0020BD99C7400020C774B984C774000AC18CACFCC885002C0020C911ACFCC885002C00100001BE00000AB300ACFCC885002C0020D2B9B300ACFCC885C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 종류라기에는 뭔가\n품종 이름처럼 들리긴 하지만 말이죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020C885B958B77CAE30C5D0B2940020BB54AC00000AD488C8850020C774B984CC98B7FC0020B4E4B9ACAE340020D558C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C8E0002E002E002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 종류부터 다른 포켓몬인지 궁금해서\n사이즈별로 호바귀를 모으고 있는데요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020C885B958BD80D1300020B2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACC778C9C00020AD81AE08D574C11C000AC0ACC774C988BCC4B85C0020D638BC14ADC0B97C0020BAA8C73CACE00020C788B294B370C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가장 큰 사이즈의 특대과종은\n아직까지 발견하지 못한 상태예요...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C7A50020D0700020C0ACC774C988C7580020D2B9B300ACFCC885C740000AC544C9C1AE4CC9C00020BC1CACACD558C9C00020BABBD55C0020C0C1D0DCC608C694002E002E002E002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종 호바귀는 15번 와일드 존에서\n밤에 모습을 드러낸다고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B294002000310035BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11C000ABC24C5D00020BAA8C2B5C7440020B4DCB7ECB0B8B2E4ACE00020D574C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드려요! 특대과종 호바귀를 잡으시면\n제게 양보해 주세요!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB824C69400210020D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B97C0020C7A1C73CC2DCBA74000AC81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC138C6940021002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종 호바귀는\n이 아이들보다 크다고 해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B294000AC7740020C544C774B4E4BCF4B2E40020D06CB2E4ACE00020D574C694002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한 가지 더 부탁드리고 싶은 게 있는데\n우두머리는 데려오지 말아 주세요...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n원래 사이즈를 알 수 없으니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55C0020AC00C9C00020B3540020BD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACE00020C2F6C7400020AC8C0020C788B294B370000AC6B0B450BA38B9ACB2940020B370B824C624C9C00020B9D0C5440020C8FCC138C694002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC6D0B7980020C0ACC774C988B97C0020C54C0020C2180020C5C6C73CB2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종 호바귀를\n제게 양보해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B97C000AC81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "주지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8FCC9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종처럼 부풀어 오르는 기대감!\n자, 빨리 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC885CC98B7FC0020BD80D480C5B40020C624B974B2940020AE30B300AC100021000AC790002C0020BE68B9AC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 원하는 건\n특대과종 호바귀예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n특대과종 호바귀는 밤에\n15번 와일드 존에서 모습을 보인다고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C6D0D558B2940020AC74000AD2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0C608C694002E00100001BE01000AD2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B2940020BC24C5D0000A00310035BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11C0020BAA8C2B5C7440020BCF4C778B2E4ACE00020D574C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우두머리 특대과종...!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아, 안 돼요! 보여 주신 건 기쁘지만\n호바귀가 이렇게나 크면 얼마나 많은 영혼을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저세상으로 데려가 버릴지 불안해서...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종처럼 부풀어 오르는 불안감!\n으으... 우두머리는 사양할게요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC885CC98B7FC0020BD80D480C5B40020C624B974B2940020BD88C548AC100021000AC73CC73C002E002E002E0020C6B0B450BA38B9ACB2940020C0ACC591D560AC8CC694002E002E002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종 호바귀...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0002E002E002E002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 커다란 몸으로 기가 사이즈의 영혼을\n저세상으로 옮기다니 정말 미스테리어스!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020CEE4B2E4B7800020BAB8C73CB85C0020AE30AC000020C0ACC774C988C7580020C601D63CC744000AC800C138C0C1C73CB85C0020C62EAE30B2E4B2C80020C815B9D00020BBF8C2A4D14CB9ACC5B4C2A4002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "닮았지만 사이즈가 이 정도로 다르니\n다른 종류의 포켓몬이라는 게 납득이 가네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2EEC558C9C0B9CC0020C0ACC774C988AC000020C7740020C815B3C4B85C0020B2E4B974B2C8000AB2E4B9780020C885B958C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2940020AC8C0020B0A9B4DDC7740020AC00B124C694002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...죄송해요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n솔직히 잘 모르겠는데, 사이즈에 압도되어서\n그만 납득이 간다고 말해 버렸어요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC8C4C1A1D574C694002E00100001BE01000AC194C9C1D7880020C7980020BAA8B974ACA0B294B370002C0020C0ACC774C988C5D00020C555B3C4B418C5B4C11C000AADF8B9CC0020B0A9B4DDC7740020AC04B2E4ACE00020B9D0D5740020BC84B838C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 사이즈에 걸맞게\n저도 영혼을 크게 키우겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C0ACC774C988C5D00020AC78B9DEAC8C000AC800B3C40020C601D63CC7440020D06CAC8C0020D0A4C6B0ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특대과종 호바귀를 주셔서\n정말 감사해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9B300ACFCC8850020D638BC14ADC0B97C0020C8FCC154C11C000AC815B9D00020AC10C0ACD574C694002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호바귀를 모두 모은 덕분에 어떤 사이즈의\n영혼도 저세상으로 옮겨 드릴 수 있으니<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n필요하시면 언제든지 말씀해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638BC14ADC0B97C0020BAA8B4500020BAA8C7400020B355BD84C5D00020C5B4B5A40020C0ACC774C988C758000AC601D63CB3C40020C800C138C0C1C73CB85C0020C62EACA80020B4DCB9B40020C2180020C788C73CB2C800100001BE00000AD544C694D558C2DCBA740020C5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020B9D0C500D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
